    "sahaaya_guardrail": "Because overall_score is a deterministic weighted linear combination of normalized indicators, regressing overall_score on these same 11 indicators yields a trivial identity with R^2 ~ 1.0, producing circular and uninformative SHAP explanations. In SAHAAYA: (1) Unsupervised clustering and Isolation Forest are trained on standardized indicators to discover intrinsic data geometry rather than predict overall_score. (2) Counterfactual simulation uses explicit linear index sensitivity accounting rather than an in-sample regression black box, ensuring 100% transparency with zero circular leakage."
